# The database, journal and dashboard ARE the experiment's public record —
# they are tracked and committed back by the daily GitHub Actions run.
#
# Ignored below: re-downloadable caches (daily prices, weekly fundamentals,
# quarterly insider archives) that would bloat the repo for no benefit.
# Two caches ARE kept because they're expensive to rebuild and tiny:
#   data/cache/sic_map.parquet          (one-time sector map)
#   data/cache/companyfacts_fill.parquet (per-company fundamentals fallback)
data/cache/*
!data/cache/sic_map.parquet
!data/cache/companyfacts_fill.parquet
__pycache__/
*.pyc
